  [
    #align(center)[
      #box(
        inset: 9pt,
        stroke: 0.6pt + gray,
        radius: 3pt,
      )[
        创建或唤醒 → `Ready` → 调度选中 → `Running`

        #v(0.7em)
        时间片耗尽或主动让出：`Running` → `Ready`

        #v(0.7em)
        等待事件：`Running` → `Blocked` → `Ready`

        #v(0.7em)
